How It Works
User clicks "Federate" in the SP → Redirected to Ping Identity Login Page.
User logs in on IdP → Ping Identity sends SAML Assertion to SP.
SP verifies assertion signature & decrypts it using Ping Identity’s public key.
Extracts user attributes and displays the requested page.
Testing the Setup
Start the SP (localhost:8080).
Visit /saml2/authenticate/pingidp → Redirects to IdP.
Log in using Ping Identity.
Visit /user to see assertion attributes.
Visit /logout to initiate Single Logout.
